Refer to AGENTS.md for full project context, architecture, and code conventions.

Engine: Godot 4.x with GDScript only.
Design Spec: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-05-operation-storm-shooter-design.md
Architecture: docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
Conventions: docs/CONVENTIONS.md

Key Rules:
- Use GDScript only, no C# files
- Use Godot 4 APIs (CharacterBody2D, @export, @onready, not Godot 3 equivalents)
- Follow snake_case for variables/functions, PascalCase for classes/nodes
- Always add type hints to function signatures
- Prefer signals over direct node references
- Keep scripts under 300 lines
- Read the design spec before implementing gameplay features
